Now fix 5 and 6 in app.js.

Fix 6 first (saveToDB honest errors):

```js
async function saveToDB() {
  const errs = [];
  try { await idbSet(KEY_SETTINGS, settings); } catch (e) { errs.push('настройки: ' + saveErrText(e)); }
  try {
    const store = structuredClone(project);
    store.pages.forEach(p => delete p.url);
    await idbSet(KEY_PROJECT, store);
  } catch (e) { errs.push('проект: ' + saveErrText(e)); }
  if (errs.length) throw new Error(errs.join('; '));
}

function saveErrText(e) {
  const n = e && (e.name || '');
  if (n === 'QuotaExceededError' || /quota/i.test(String(e && e.message))) {
    return 'не хватило места в хранилище браузера (IndexedDB). Удалите лишние проекты/клипы или сократите проект';
  }
  return (e && e.message) || String(e);
}
```

And `autoSaveTimer` → `setTimeout(() => { saveToDB().catch(() => {}); }, 600)`. But then autosave failures are silent again. Better: show a toast once (debounced) on autosave failure. Let me make autoSaveTimer report the error via toast but only once per failure streak, to avoid spam.

```js
const autoSaveTimer = (() => {
  let t = null;
  let warned = false;
  return () => {
    clearTimeout(t);
    t = setTimeout(async () => {
      try {
        await saveToDB();
        warned = false;
      } catch (e) {
        if (!warned) { warned = true; toast('Автосохранение: ' + e.message, 'err'); }
      }
    }, 600);
  };
})();
```

And `saveProject` will now properly throw → its try/catch shows the error.

Fix 5: importProject + bindSettings idempotency.

For `bindSettings` idempotency: add a module-level `let settingsListenersBound = false;` and guard the listener registrations. The functions `bindSel`, `bindInp`, `bindRange`, and the inline ones in `bindSettings` (opt-music change, btnPickModel click, custom input) all add listeners.

Cleanest: introduce a helper `once(fn)` that registers a listener only the first time bindSettings runs.

```js
let uiBound = false;
/* Регистрация слушателей ровно один раз: bindSettings() зовётся повторно при
 * импорте проекта и сбросе, и без этого га каждый обработчик дублировался. */
function onFirstBind(el, type, fn) {
  if (uiBound) return;
  el.addEventListener(type, fn);
}
```
Then replace all `X.addEventListener(...)` inside bindSel/bindInp/bindRange/bindSettings/setupModelUi with `onFirstBind(X, type, fn)`, and at the end of `bindSettings()`: `uiBound = true;`.

Careful: `setupModelUi()` is called from `bindSettings()`. And `populateProviderSelect()`/`populateOcrSelect()` must still run every time (they repopulate). Yes, they stay outside the guard.

Now `importProject` — honest version:

```js
async function importProject(file) {
  try {
    const j = JSON.parse(await file.text());
    if (!j.project) throw new Error('Файл не похож на проект VoiceComic');
